Arctic Prime:

Keep the current GitHub email exactly the same.

Only change the Git commit display name for this system.

Set:
git config --global user.name "Arctic Prime"

Do NOT modify:

- user.email
- GitHub login
- authentication
- remote URLs

After changing the local Git display name:

1. verify it worked
2. notify Control Prime of the naming structure
3. Control Prime should later use:
   git config --global user.name "Control Prime"

Goal:
Both systems keep the same GitHub account/email but have different visible commit names for tracking and recovery purposes.